+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is required on all builds, including development builds, with no exception; this reverses an earlier, since-retired workaround that had disabled verification in development builds, and it establishes a uniform security posture across development, staging, and production environments so that no divergence in TLS validation behavior can carry over between build types.
